sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant GA as GitHub Action / CLI
    participant GHA as GitHub API
    participant GEN as Generator (Python)
    participant LLM as LLM API (Claude/OpenAI)
    participant OUT as Repo / Release

    Dev->>GA: push tag v1.4.0 (or run CLI)
    GA->>GHA: get previous tag (v1.3.0)
    GA->>GHA: list commits + merged PRs between tags
    GHA-->>GA: commits, PR titles, bodies, labels
    GA->>GEN: raw change list + config (tone, audience)
    GEN->>GEN: normalize + classify + filter noise
    GEN->>LLM: prompt: grouped changes + style template
    LLM-->>GEN: draft changelog (structured JSON)
    GEN->>GEN: validate schema, render Markdown
    GEN->>OUT: open PR updating CHANGELOG.md
    GEN->>OUT: publish GitHub Release notes
    OUT-->>Dev: review + merge (human in the loop)
